  answer="Basic maintenance at home means hygiene and gentle handling: keep crystals clear, bracelets free of grit, and crowns seated — movement servicing (opening, cleaning, oiling) belongs in a workshop with timing equipment. The goal is preserving condition, not improvising lubrication."
